WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.026
Carbon is stored in every sphere and moves between the stores.

2
00:00:04.753 --> 00:00:09.628
Four stores: the air, living things and soil, the oceans, and fossil fuels.

3
00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:14.805
The arrows are flows: carbon moving between stores each year.

4
00:00:16.797 --> 00:00:20.472
Carbon moves around, but none is made or destroyed.
